Patches identified during the Step-04 adversarial / edge-case / verification-gap review of Story 4.6:

- IncidentDetailActions.tsx: re-attach `id="incident-detail-assign-select"`
  on the Technician <select> so the sibling `<label htmlFor>` actually
  targets it (a11y). Wrapped in eslint-disable react/forbid-dom-props
  with an inline rationale mirroring forms/FormField.tsx:73. Drop the
  redundant `aria-label` since the htmlFor association is now live.
- IncidentDetailPage.spec.tsx: add 5 new test suites that close the
  verification-gap report — NOT_FOUND_404 (toast + <NotFound />),
  FORBIDDEN_403 (toast + <RbacDenied /> + rowFetchCount === 2),
  TOKEN_EXPIRED_401 (5xx-class: toast + rowFetchCount === 1, no
  invalidation), BODY_VALIDATION_400 (4xx-class: toast + rowFetchCount
  === 2), and a TOAST_TTL fake-timer integration test that exercises
  the 4-second auto-dismiss path with `vi.useFakeTimers()`.

Spec status flipped from in-progress to in-review as part of the same
commit so the artifact tracks the patch delivery.

